  "text": "If youre looking to make the wise relocation of trading in your paper for gold or silver, come on by (literally, we cant accept any orders however those made in person!)!\nUnless you have been living under a rock this past week, youll understand that gold has taken an incredible plunge. With the substantial drop in price, gold bugs everywhere are purchasing up as much as their wallets allow. Demand for gold has escalated and sadly there is not sufficient to walk around! The shortage has shot up premiums, putting the precious metal at around $1500 an ounce. The very same goes for here in NYC. Products are selling out rapidly and whatever weve offered in the past week our dealerships are telling us will not be offered for months. Orders can not even be positioned until May and shipments will not deliver until June! This indicates what we got now is all we got until June. And its not just gold that is running low, silver is going into scarcity also. Recently we got a call from among our dealers that offers us silver American Eagle Coins. He provided to redeem what he offered us at twice the premium we bought it for, even after it had actually already delivered!\n.\nHave a fantastic day!\nHe used to buy back what he offered us at two times the premium we bought it for, even after it had actually already shipped!\nIf youre looking to make the wise relocation of trading in your paper for gold or silver, come on by (actually, we cant accept any orders but those made in person!)!\nBullion Trading LLC.\nbulliontrading\nView all posts\nPrevious Post\nWhat Can You Get For Your Gold?\nNext Post\nWhy Customers Choose Bullion Trading LLC",
